{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders","id":1528287,"title":"Blood Stained Love is now available on PDF for preorders","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-01-09T16:12:10-08:00","id":1528287,"title":"Blood Stained Love is now available on PDF for preorders","content":"Hey folks,<br /> <br /> I am pleased to say that BLOOD STAINED LOVE is now available from Renegade Studios. I am actually excited about this one because I admit, while I didn't like the treatment of the Sabbat or Second Inquisition, I feel like more oft-kilter roleplaying-based works is where 5th Edition is meant to shine.<br /> <br /> <img width=\"759\" height=\"957\" data-align=\"none\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/images/stencil/1280x1280/products/1133/4728/V5_Blood_Stained_Love_FLAT_FRONT__87459.1704812245.jpg?c=1\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/images/stencil/1280x1280/products/1133/4728/V5_Blood_Stained_Love_FLAT_FRONT__87459.1704812245.jpg?c=1\" data-thumb-url=\"https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-kftzvkkgjv/images/stencil/1280x1280/products/1133/4728/V5_Blood_Stained_Love_FLAT_FRONT__87459.1704812245.jpg?c=1\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment thumbnail js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/><br /> <br /> <i>Can the Kindred ever truly love?<br /> <br /> Expand your game of personal and political horror to include wide-eyed lovers and manipulative monsters. The book is for Storytellers and players alike, giving you tools, techniques and advice on how to bring romance to the undead. This book includes 6 six fleshed out storytelling characters and six detailed story concepts, all designed to maximize romance potential.<br /> <br /> <b>Features</b></i><ul><li><i>How to play your character in stories of romance.</i></li> <li><i>How to build your chronicle from the ground up so that the options for romance are maximized or minimized.</i></li> <li><i>Six fully fleshed out Storyteller characters specifically designed for romance.</i></li> <li><i>Six detailed story concepts created to maximize romantic potential.</i></li> <li><i>Advice and tools for safety and calibration, expanding on the corebook\u2019s Advice for Considerate Play appendix.</i></li> <li><i>Tools for defining and maintaining everyone\u2019s boundaries at the table.</i></li> <li><i>Sections on alternate methods for playing romance.</i></li> <li><i>Merits, Flaws and Discipline powers related to romance.</i></li> </ul><i>\u200b</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T19:59:15-08:00","id":1528295,"title":"","content":"While it's a good topic to get to (though VtR did it too)... it's hard to be excited when Paradox had to get a free supplement together ASAP, again, because previews riled up everyone for how poorly it handled something. Highly focused books like this need solid writing that fully address what&quot;s being explored... that's the whole point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T20:40:26-08:00","id":1528296,"title":"","content":"They really should've taken the time to remove the text that caused the controversy and worked in this new free document to replace it. The free document is an improvement but it serves to highlight why the original previewed pages were an issue. They mention right there on the first page in this free add-on-document where they quote Emily Care Boss who coined the term: &quot;The overlap between player and character emotions. May be positive, negative or otherwise.&quot; And the issue will immediately become apparent when it's contrasted with this quote from the book-preview (which is a good summation of the tone of that section): &quot;Bleed is one of the big reasons why romantic play is fun.&quot; Bleed can be positive. It can also be negative. So to give it this blanket &quot;It's fun!&quot;-description is an issue. Because the statement &quot;Bleed is one of the big reasons why romantic play can turn out to be very un-fun.&quot; is equally valid. If anything, the free document is too short because now the next step after explaining Bleed in this nuanced fashion is to get to &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot; and explain that in a more nuanced fashion that isn't just &quot;It's fun!&quot;. There are methods and practices to pursuing Bleed aka &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot;. And having read those texts mentioned at the end of the document, I found those texts still more illuminating than what's offered by this new free document.<br /> <br /> In regards to the links at the end of the free document... There's a reason I had already read those blog-posts because when the controversy happened the RPG-scholar Jonaya Kemper posted a list of links in regards to Bleed on Twitter - and that list you find at the end of the free add-on-document is a copy-paste of that list.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T21:02:31-08:00","id":1528297,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528295#post1528295\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While it's a good topic to get to (though VtR did it too)... it's hard to be excited when Paradox had to get a free supplement together ASAP, again, because previews riled up everyone for how poorly it handled something. Highly focused books like this need solid writing that fully address what&quot;s being explored... that's the whole point.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, the vast majority of companies wouldn't make any changes whatsoever.<br /> <br /> This is actually quite impressive in its speed.<br /> <br /> But I admit I have no idea what the controversy was or what the offending passage was.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T21:09:57-08:00","id":1528298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528297#post1528297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I admit I have no idea what the controversy was or what the offending passage was.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1525250-v5-blood-stained-love-and-bleed\">a thread on this forum</a> that discusses the controversy<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-09T23:10:35-08:00","id":1528305,"title":"","content":"The phrase 'maximise romantic potential' and that cover aside, I'm genuinely optermisticly curious were they're going with this. The tools are probably going to need a mechanic to circumvent the hunger dice and some addressing of blood bonds so this has some potential to introduce useful mechanics.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T02:02:39-08:00","id":1528310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528297#post1528297\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Eh, the vast majority of companies wouldn't make any changes whatsoever.</div> </div> </div> </div>That doesn't make it good. Especially as a repeat problem for V5. They're not operating on some fast paced supplement treadmill schedule. They have time to not make these sorts of mistakes. Plenty of indie games have far superior sections on this topic, so some sort of &quot;expense&quot; defense doesn't really fly. Lots of companies don't put out free PDF supplements to correct their mistakes? OK. That doesn't mean it's a good thing to keep making the same mistakes multiple times on something you expect people to pay money for. It's not like this is some new topic nobody has ever written extensively on before.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This is actually quite impressive in its speed. </div> </div> </div>Two months is impressive for a few pages, many of which are copied from open sources? Most of the professional RPG writers that deal with these issues in their games regularly could have banged this out in a week as a side project.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528305#post1528305\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The phrase 'maximise romantic potential' and that cover aside, I'm genuinely optermisticly curious were they're going with this. The tools are probably going to need a mechanic to circumvent the hunger dice and some addressing of blood bonds so this has some potential to introduce useful mechanics.</div> </div> </div> </div>As I understand it, there's extremely little in the ways of new mechanics, and most of those are, as listed, just building up on existing Traits like Merits. It doesn't seem to be a terribly long book (and V5 tends to have a lot of art and white space that eats up pages fast), which a lot of subjects that need plenty of page count that aren't mechanical in nature. I highly doubt there's going to be any major changes in it on things like Hunger (though the previews for it do include a Flaw that modifies Blood Bond rules, so it's possible there's more in their that uses that approach).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T06:37:16-08:00","id":1528313,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528298#post1528298\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> There's <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1525250-v5-blood-stained-love-and-bleed\">a thread on this forum</a> that discusses the controversy<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, this is one of those, &quot;Nordic LARP takes method acting way too seriously&quot; things, isn't it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T08:22:02-08:00","id":1528320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528313#post1528313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, this is one of those, &quot;Nordic LARP takes method acting way too seriously&quot; things, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair I also don't think much of how nordic sometimes treat the game as a group therapy session either. As a brit that and the method acting makes me want to pull my jaw over my face lol.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-10T09:59:11-08:00","id":1528326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528313#post1528313\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, this is one of those, &quot;Nordic LARP takes method acting way too seriously&quot; things, isn't it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Not method-acting per se (although I could see it with how intense the tone was when the performing-aspect of roleplaying was discussed in that one link on a Jane Austen LARP) but the two pages that were shown had this upbeat tone about Bleed and made recommendations like how you should play characters that are similar to you or how you should bring in your own life-experiences to the roleplaying to increase Bleed... Because what the section is going for is trying to sell you on &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot;. And I think the WOD-lead-developer Juhana Pettersson (on the Renegade-team-side, not the Paradox-in-house-team-side) who has a background in Nordic LARP just got stuck in his own perspective on Bleed when he tried to champion a specific Nordic LARP concept like &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot;. He didn't take into account that the wider RPG-community has a much more varied relationship with Bleed than how it's handled in Nordic LARP specifically.<br /> <br /> And the previous books (like the V5 corebook and the Players Guide) had a more general and cautious take on it, more along the lines of &quot;It happens, it can be bad, be careful.&quot;. So to then take the deep plunge here with &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot; and talk about something like &quot;How to increase Bleed&quot; seems like quite the leap. That's why that additional document was necessary. And that's why I feel like the document should've kept going. You have the groundwork for what Bleed is and now you need a couple more pages to talk about &quot;Bleed-hunting&quot; and how to handle that. You get it from the links provided in the document but it should appear in the published material being discussed in original writing. One, just presenting links is tricky because you never know if things will change (the link to the Expanded Storyteller mechanics in the W5 corebook is already out of date, for example) and two, offering some original writing on the topic lets the writers tailor the text to what VtM is about.<br /> <br /> Ultimately it's not like there's anything wrong with proposing Nordic LARP specific concepts. Some people will like it, some people won't. It's a specific approach to roleplaying that can be there as a suggestion. And the issue was that it wasn't presented as a suggestion. Especially since this concerns player-emotions, it should come with quite a few caveats and the stakes are raised because this isn't just about roleplaying in general but <i>romantic </i>roleplaying in particular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-11T13:49:19-08:00","id":1528392,"title":"","content":"I feel like the time for this supplement to come out was during the Twilight craze. I do not understand why they won't do something like Beckett's jyhad diary mk2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5617-vendrin","name":"Vendrin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5617_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-11T14:10:15-08:00","id":1528394,"title":"","content":"The interplay of vampires and romance has been a staple of pop culture for ~150 years now. While I can understand the case that V5 has more pressing topics to make books on because they're specific to V5 play, RPGs were you play vampires are always going to be &quot;the right time&quot; to have discussions about romance in the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-11T14:28:04-08:00","id":1528395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vendrin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528392#post1528392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I do not understand why they won't do something like Beckett's jyhad diary mk2.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that would be pretty obvious, considering that none of the first BHJ plot points are being followed up on and W5 has had many strong statements emphasizing that it is a &quot;reimagining rather than a continuation&quot; of W:tA. And H&quot;5&quot;? Where do we even start with that one?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-11T16:51:59-08:00","id":1528402,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528395#post1528395\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think that would be pretty obvious, considering that none of the first BHJ plot points are being followed up on and W5 has had many strong statements emphasizing that it is a &quot;reimagining rather than a continuation&quot; of W:tA. And H&quot;5&quot;? Where do we even start with that one?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a partial truth. Quite a few plotlines from BJD were in fact followed up on because they continued from the old Metaplot.<br /> <br /> * The Assamites joined the Camarilla<br /> * The Los Angeles Free States has been re-established<br /> * The Followers of Set tried to join the Camarilla and got rejected.<br /> * Milwaukee is exactly like it was established by Dawkins (gee, I wonder why)<br /> * The Family Reunion was planned by OPP and they got to execute it in Cults of the Blood Gods.<br /> * Vitel being Emperor of Washington DC was confirmed via side bars.<br /> * The Fourth Sabbat Civil War did happen, it just resulted in a purge of the Path of Honorable Accord and the Sabbat becoming murderhobos.<br /> <br /> There's a few places where it isn't true but there's reasons for that too.<br /> <br /> * You can't continue the Kue Jin plots because they've been rendered noncanonical.<br /> <br /> As for H:TR I'm of the controversial opinion that they actually were making the appropriate reaction there. The whole point of Hunter was that you were ordinary people who fought monsters. If allowed to form an actual society and function for 20 years continuously being empowered, you would have a very different feeling world.<br /> <br /> I still wish we'd gotten it as an option but not a focus.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd22","count":2},{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-12T17:15:24-08:00","id":1528461,"title":"","content":"Anyone read the book in question and can give more of their opinion? I'm really eager to know more about this book, cuz for me Blood Sigils was a very good surprise! (I had no faith in blood sigils until I read it)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Strange... When coincidence seems too convenient, I prefer to call it fate.</i><br /> <br /> <b><sup>-Blood Omen: Legacy of Kain</sup> </b>d=","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25534-banu_saulot","name":"Banu_Saulot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25534_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"335"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-12T17:27:01-08:00","id":1528463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Banu_Saulot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528461#post1528461\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Anyone read the book in question and can give more of their opinion? I'm really eager to know more about this book, cuz for me Blood Sigils was a very good surprise! (I had no faith in blood sigils until I read it)</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm starting my &quot;preorder read&quot; tonight and will be doing a big review for this site and others when I can.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-01-13T13:39:38-08:00","id":1528496,"title":"","content":"And my review is up!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528491-bloodstained-love-review\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/filedata/fetch?filedataid=1074\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528491-bloodstained-love-review\"> Bloodstained Love review - Onyx Path Forums </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528491-bloodstained-love-review\"> https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528491-bloodstained-love-review </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> link: https://unitedfederationofcharles.blogspot.com/2024/01/vampire-masquerade-bloodstained-love.html BLOODSTAINED LOVE is the latest supplement for VAMPIRE: THE MASQUERADE and I have to say that it is a supplement I was looking forward to a lot. I admit not entirely for beneficent reasons because my reaction to the premise, </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-12T13:47:14-07:00","id":1532452,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vendrin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1528392#post1528392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel like the time for this supplement to come out was during the Twilight craze. I do not understand why they won't do something like Beckett's jyhad diary mk2.</div> </div> </div> </div>the most successful vampire show of 2023 was a adaptation of anne rice interview ith a vampire which has more talk of romance than any other vampires tory.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-13T04:20:40-07:00","id":1532490,"title":"","content":"Having read the book, I would say it's only worth getting if your VtM-game is the kind that includes scenes that get intimate (from romantic to outright erotic) and if your game has a particular focus on relationship-dynamics with the emotional needs and characteristics of the PCs being foregrounded during the game. And if you're not familiar with the bad effects Bleed can have, also get the free pdf they released alongside this supplement. Bleed-hunting isn't something people new to roleplaying should ever pursue (so I think there's a bit more caution to be advised than what the book offers on the topic, I think).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T12:02:50-07:00","id":1532711,"title":"","content":"Honest takes everyone, Is this book worth checking out and even buying at all?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-03-16T13:29:39-07:00","id":1532721,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1528287-blood-stained-love-is-now-available-on-pdf-for-preorders?p=1532711#post1532711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Honest takes everyone, Is this book worth checking out and even buying at all?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, if your VtM-game you play with your friends has a lot of romance and highly emotional roleplaying between PCs or between a PC and NPCs, sure. Otherwise, no.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","d